{"id":"7ec7ee7f07c69bd5","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-product-type.md","title":"df-product-type","display":"df-product-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-product-type","aliases":["16-df-product-type","Product type"],"display":"df-product-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"source":"Example 10.1.2 p.588 (PDF608); Proposition 10.1.3 p.589 (PDF609)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-product-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-product-type</span><span>Product type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-product-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 10.1.2 p.588 (PDF608); Proposition 10.1.3 p.589 (PDF609)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a> 的强一阶演算、判断等式与带型属构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A,B:\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A,B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 自由出现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\)</span> 中按削弱读取。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 在结论所定义的乘积类型中取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 是下节定义的句法缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\\coloneqq\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\qquad\n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b),\\qquad\n\\pi_1(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P),\\quad\n\\pi_2(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\times B\\coloneqq\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\qquad\n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b),\\qquad\n\\pi_1(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P),\\quad\n\\pi_2(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A\\times B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\qquad\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):A\\times B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash A\\times B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\qquad\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):A\\times B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(P):A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(P):B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(P):A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(P):B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(a,b)= a:A,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(a,b)= b:B,\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}{\\Gamma\\vdash(\\pi_1(P),\\pi_2(P))= P:A\\times B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(a,b)= a:A,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(a,b)= b:B,\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}{\\Gamma\\vdash(\\pi_1(P),\\pi_2(P))= P:A\\times B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Example 10.1.2 p.588（PDF608）、Proposition 10.1.3 p.589（PDF609）。乘积是非依赖和的缩写，投影与 βη 由强和规则得到。旧页裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty},\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty},\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span> 没有规定是原始语法、商还是集合族；本页明确采用句法判断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-dtt-signature]] 的强一阶演算、判断等式与带型属构造子。$\\Gamma\\vdash A,B:\\mathsf{Ty}$，$x$ 不在 $B$ 自由出现，$B$ 在 $\\Gamma,x:A$ 中按削弱读取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A,B:\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash a:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash b:B","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B\\coloneqq\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\qquad\n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b),\\qquad\n\\pi_1(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P),\\quad\n\\pi_2(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A\\times B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\qquad\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):A\\times B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(P):A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(P):B}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(a,b)= a:A,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(a,b)= b:B,\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B}{\\Gamma\\vdash(\\pi_1(P),\\pi_2(P))= P:A\\times B}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty},\\mathsf{Tm}","display":false}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-product-type|df-product-type]]"}],"outgoing":["3b1238220cc5942f"]}